OL,3,GNEWSACalls for 'fitting tribute' to
OL,4,Agoalkeeping legend
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootball fans have called for a
OL,7,Fpermanent tribute to honour their
OL,8,Fformer goalkeeper, known as The Legend.
OL,10,FAlan Knight played 801 games for
OL,11,FPortsmouth Football Club in a career
OL,12,Fwhich stretched from 1978 to 2000 - a
OL,13,Frecord for a keeper at a single English
OL,14,Fclub.
OL,16,FThe 65-year-old died on Tuesday after
OL,17,Fbeing diagnosed with prostate cancer in
OL,18,F2024. Fans and former players have been
OL,19,Fremembering Knight who they have
OL,20,Fdescribed as "a proper Pompey man".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
